# agent-gate summary-integrity FAIL siblings for the checkout-default paths (#2874): the
# no-clobber live-peer publish drops "<default-summary>.integrity-fail.<run-id>" next to the
# pinned path; ignore them so an incident never dirties the tree (job-2107 LOW#1).
/.agent-gate-summary.txt.integrity-fail.*
!/.agent-gate-summary.txt.integrity-fail.*/
/.agent-gate-lite-summary.txt.integrity-fail.*
!/.agent-gate-lite-summary.txt.integrity-fail.*/
/.agent-gate-delta-summary.txt.integrity-fail.*
!/.agent-gate-delta-summary.txt.integrity-fail.*/
# agent-gate liveness heartbeat for the checkout-default summary paths (#3473). The gate
# rewrites these every 20s for the whole run; they are runtime artifacts, never source.
# The tree-integrity guard carves them out explicitly too (_tree_excluded) — that is what
# covers a caller-PINNED in-repo summary path, which no .gitignore rule can predict. These
# entries additionally keep the checkout clean and stop a heartbeat left by an EARLIER run
# from counting against a later one.
# A '!<path>/' NEGATION FOLLOWS EVERY ENTRY, and it is load-bearing (roborev job 209). A gitignore
# pattern matches a FILE OR A DIRECTORY of that name, and git does not descend into an ignored
# directory — so without the negations, source placed under `.agent-gate-summary.txt.launch-lock/`
# was invisible to `git ls-files --others --exclude-standard`, which is exactly how tree-integrity
# enumerates untracked files. Measured: 0 descendants visible. That recreated, through a SECOND
# channel, the subtree-wide false-clean behaviour `_tree_excluded` had already been narrowed twice to
# prevent — the gate's own predicate was fixed while .gitignore kept doing the same thing.
#
# The negation form matters and the obvious one does NOT work. Measured in a throwaway repo:
#     !<path>/**   ->  0 descendants visible   (git never descends, so ** is never consulted)
#     !<path>/     ->  1 descendant visible    (trailing slash matches the DIRECTORY, re-including it)
# Glob entries take the same form (`!<glob>/`), verified the same way.
/.agent-gate-summary.txt.heartbeat
/.agent-gate-summary.txt.heartbeat.launch-lock
!/.agent-gate-summary.txt.heartbeat.launch-lock/
!/.agent-gate-summary.txt.heartbeat/
/.agent-gate-lite-summary.txt.heartbeat
/.agent-gate-lite-summary.txt.heartbeat.launch-lock
!/.agent-gate-lite-summary.txt.heartbeat.launch-lock/
!/.agent-gate-lite-summary.txt.heartbeat/
/.agent-gate-delta-summary.txt.heartbeat
/.agent-gate-delta-summary.txt.heartbeat.launch-lock
!/.agent-gate-delta-summary.txt.heartbeat.launch-lock/
!/.agent-gate-delta-summary.txt.heartbeat/
/.agent-gate-summary.txt.launch-lock
!/.agent-gate-summary.txt.launch-lock/
/.agent-gate-summary.txt.launch-lock.mutex
!/.agent-gate-summary.txt.launch-lock.mutex/
/.agent-gate-lite-summary.txt.launch-lock
!/.agent-gate-lite-summary.txt.launch-lock/
/.agent-gate-lite-summary.txt.launch-lock.mutex
!/.agent-gate-lite-summary.txt.launch-lock.mutex/
/.agent-gate-delta-summary.txt.launch-lock
!/.agent-gate-delta-summary.txt.launch-lock/
/.agent-gate-delta-summary.txt.launch-lock.mutex
!/.agent-gate-delta-summary.txt.launch-lock.mutex/
/.agent-gate-summary.txt.heartbeat.tmp.*
!/.agent-gate-summary.txt.heartbeat.tmp.*/
/.agent-gate-lite-summary.txt.heartbeat.tmp.*
!/.agent-gate-lite-summary.txt.heartbeat.tmp.*/
/.agent-gate-delta-summary.txt.heartbeat.tmp.*
!/.agent-gate-delta-summary.txt.heartbeat.tmp.*/

